WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Going to the movies has a set time. Going to the game has a set time.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.100
Going to work has a set time. So why doesn't taking care of your health, which matters so much more, have a set time?

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:14.100
Haddad will create the Hora Certa Network: appointments, tests and even minor surgeries, all scheduled.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.000
Haddad 13.
